        <section class="nb-coach nb-section" id="nb-coach"><div class="nb-photo-frame"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534438327276-14e5300c3a48?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=88" alt="Coach in a performance gym"><span>COACH ALEXANDRA REYES</span></div><div class="nb-coach-copy"><span class="nb-kicker">MEET YOUR COACH</span><h2>Experience builds<br><em>better coaching.</em></h2><p>I’m Alexandra, a certified personal trainer and strength coach. My job is to turn complicated fitness advice into a practical plan you can trust, repeat, and enjoy.</p><div class="nb-credentials"><div><b>NSCA-CPT</b><small>Certified personal trainer</small></div><div><b>CSCS</b><small>Strength &amp; conditioning</small></div><div><b>8 YEARS</b><small>Coaching experience</small></div></div><a class="nb-text-link" href="#nb-booking">Work with Alexandra <b>↗</b></a></div></section>
        <section class="nb-programs nb-section" id="nb-programs"><div class="nb-heading"><div><span class="nb-kicker">TRAINING PROGRAMS</span><h2>A clear plan for<br><em>your next level.</em></h2></div><p>Every program starts with an assessment, then adapts to your lifestyle, ability, and goal. No guesswork. No copy-paste routines.</p></div><div class="nb-program-grid"><article><span>01</span><div class="nb-card-icon">↘</div><h3>Weight loss</h3><p>Build sustainable habits, improve your strength, and lose fat without extreme restrictions.</p><a href="#nb-booking">Explore program <b>↗</b></a></article><article><span>02</span><div class="nb-card-icon">＋</div><h3>Muscle building</h3><p>Progressive strength training and nutrition guidance designed around your real schedule.</p><a href="#nb-booking">Explore program <b>↗</b></a></article><article><span>03</span><div class="nb-card-icon">↗</div><h3>Strength training</h3><p>Get stronger with purposeful programming, technique coaching, and measurable milestones.</p><a href="#nb-booking">Explore program <b>↗</b></a></article><article><span>04</span><div class="nb-card-icon">◎</div><h3>Personal coaching</h3><p>High-touch support for clients who want a complete plan and consistent accountability.</p><a href="#nb-booking">Explore program <b>↗</b></a></article></div></section>
